---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="소개 — sepn0r" description="개발자 & 강사 소개">
  <section class="fade-in">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight">소개</h1>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
      안녕하세요, <strong class="text-neutral-900 font-semibold">sepn0r</strong>입니다.
      개발자이자 강사로서 활동하고 있습니다.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">활동</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-neutral-600">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-neutral-300 shrink-0"></span>
            소프트웨어 개발
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-neutral-300 shrink-0"></span>
            프로그래밍 강의
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-neutral-300 shrink-0"></span>
            실습 자료 제작
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">연락처</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          궁금한 점이 있으시면 편하게 연락해주세요.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
